<title>GERMANY: Henkel says Jan-Feb sales, profits higher.</title>
<headline>Henkel says Jan-Feb sales, profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemical group Henkel KGaA said on Monday revenues and earnings across all its divisions for the January-February period were higher than for the corresponding period of last year.</p>
<p>Speaking at a news briefing, Henkel chief Hans-Dietrich Winkhaus also said its recent takeover of U.S.-based Loctite would affect results negatively this year due to the cost of funding the deal and restructuring measures.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
